ata rather than as a transcript, verifies claims with the acceptance evaluator, and decides each next round. Never does the work itself.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"kirocrew-ledger-conductor\"}}},{\"name\":\"kirocrew-lite\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"kirocrew-lite\"}}},{\"name\":\"kirocrew-pipeline-conductor\",\"description\":\"Runs one repository pipeline as a supervised fleet: picks up queued work items, dispatches one worker session per item, probes and verifies them, intervenes on stalls, adjudicates blocked items, and governs host resources and per-item credit budgets. Never does a work item's work itself.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"kirocrew-pipeline-conductor\"}}},{\"name\":\"kirocrew-research\",\"description\":\"Autonomous research worker — runs one research cycle per turn in a Research Lab campaign loop.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"kirocrew-research\"}}},{\"name\":\"kirocrew-security-conductor\",\"description\":\"Runs one security audit as a supervised fleet: decomposes a target into attack surfaces, dispatches one auditor session per surface and an independent verifier per finding, adjudicates severity, and gates any fix behind a human yes. Never touches the target itself.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"orig