ke or prototype an idea, continue, implement, or verify a spec, ask for its status, review its requirements or design, check whether specs are ready, or put a spec on hold, abandon it, or resume it.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"power\",\"power\":{\"name\":\"specflow\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}}}},\"originalName\":\"spec-workflow\"}}}]}}}\ndocs/dev/project-management/autopilot/reports/00111-c1-20261101-bob-output-3a4a39bb1147407db63f6febd0f84a3f.jsonl:6:{\"type\":\"sessionUpdate\",\"data\":{\"sessionId\":\"sess_11d83089-d220-4b57-a2d5-95a2df88a73a\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"available_commands_update\",\"availableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"general-task-execution\",\"description\":\"General-purpose sub-agent with access to all tools for executing arbitrary tasks\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"commandId\":\"general-task-execution\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"bundled\"}},\"originalName\":\"general-task-execution\"}}},{\"name\":\"context-gatherer\",\"description\":\"Investigates the codebase to answer a specific question about it. Deeply analyzes existing code by tracing execution paths, mapping architecture and abstraction layers, understanding patterns, and documenting dependencies, returning a thorough, direct written analysis that explains how the relevant code works and points to the specific files and lines involved. Use it to understand code before you change it: before designing or implementing a change to code you don't already fully understand, start with context-gatherer so your edits are grounded in how the code actually works. When a task requires understanding code you don't already know, dispatch context-gatherer to do that exploration before running your own searches or reads. Rules: 1. Provide a clear, specific prompt that includes your intent: a detailed task description of the context you need and what you're trying to accomplish. 2. The subagent explores the codebase and returns an analysis of your query 3. Trust the returned results. You may still inspect additional code yourself when you need context beyond what was returned. 4. Reuse existing context-gatherer output for related follow-up questions; do not re-invoke on the same question with different phrasing. 5. For multiple distinct questions, dispatch several context-gatherers in parallel, each targeting a different aspect of the codebase.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"commandId\":\"context-gatherer\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"bundled\"}},\"originalName\":\"context-gatherer\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-leases-53655-0ae4580c85b9442489f9252e63d647ac\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-leases/53655-0ae4580c85b9442489f9252e63d647ac\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata-kirocrew-skill-view-0726acb0154447bbecf2cbfe\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata/kirocrew-skill-view-0726acb0154447bbecf2cbfe\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata-kirocrew-skill-view-283a3a5d12dc44c993d5cfdc\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata/kirocrew-skill-view-283a3a5d12dc44c993d5cfdc\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-proj