me question with different phrasing. 5. For multiple distinct questions, dispatch several context-gatherers in parallel, each targeting a different aspect of the codebase.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"commandId\":\"context-gatherer\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"bundled\"}},\"originalName\":\"context-gatherer\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-leases-53655-0ae4580c85b9442489f9252e63d647ac\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-leases/53655-0ae4580c85b9442489f9252e63d647ac\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata-kirocrew-skill-view-0726acb0154447bbecf2cbfe\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata/kirocrew-skill-view-0726acb0154447bbecf2cbfe\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata-kirocrew-skill-view-283a3a5d12dc44c993d5cfdc\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata/kirocrew-skill-view-283a3a5d12dc44c993d5cfdc\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata-kirocrew-skill-view-349369799f67e4230f6e9271\",\"description\":\"\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"task to delegate\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"custom-agent\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata/kirocrew-skill-view-349369799f67e4230f6e9271\"}}},{\"name\":\".kirocrew-skill-projection-metadata-kirocrew-sk