ype\":\"agent\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"review-readonly\"}}},{\"name\":\"probe-fixture\",\"description\":\"Probe skill for the specflow host loading check. Use when asked to run the specflow probe or probe-fixture.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"power\",\"power\":{\"name\":\"specflow-probe\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}}}},\"originalName\":\"probe-fixture\"}}},{\"name\":\"convert-prd\",\"description\":\"Converts an existing PRD or legacy intake item into specflow requirements, design, and tasks, or adopts an implemented PRD with its evidence kept. Use when the developer asks to convert, adopt, or graduate a PRD (\\\"convert PRD\\\", \\\"adopt PRD\\\", \\\"graduate PRD\\\"); needs a resolved source document or repository context.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"power\",\"power\":{\"name\":\"specflow\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}}}},\"originalName\":\"convert-prd\"}}},{\"name\":\"spec-workflow\",\"description\":\"specflow's spec workflow. Takes a feature or a bug from idea to verified code through Kiro-compatible requirements, design, and tasks, with an explicit approval at each gate. Use when the developer asks to create a spec, fix a bug through a spec, spike or prototype an idea, continue, implement, or verify a spec, ask for its status, review its requirements or design, check whether specs are ready, or put a spec on hold, abandon it, or resume it.\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"power\",\"power\":{\"name\":\"specflow\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}}}},\"originalName\":\"spec-workflow\"}}},{\"name\":\"apply-design-system\",\"description\":\"Use when generating design tokens, scoring visual consistency, or catching generic AI-design slop. Triggers on .css/.svelte/.ts/.tsx/.jsx/.html/.vue file edits, \\\"design system\\\", \\\"design tokens\\\", \\\"visual audit\\\", \\\"UI scoring\\\", \\\"slop check\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"apply-design-system\"}}},{\"name\":\"assess-evolution\",\"description\":\"Use when assessing a project's long-term evolution health and emitting a phased, session-sized PRD roadmap to get it back on track. Triggers on \\\"evolution audit\\\", \\\"assess this project\\\", \\\"health-check the codebase\\\", \\\"what should we refactor\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"assess-evolution\"}}},{\"name\":\"audit-qwen\",\"description\":\"Use when producing the qwen utilization report card - dispatch rate, preflight/exclusion histograms, gate pass rate, and a WIDEN/NARROW/HOLD fence verdict from batch telemetry. Triggers on \\\"audit qwen\\\", \\\"qwen report card\\\", \\\"qwen utilization\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"audit-qwen\"}}},{\"name\":\"brush\",\"description\":\"Use when running a project hygiene pass on a repo - git cleanup, leftover triage, evolution check, backlog review, AGENTS.md refresh. Triggers on \\\"brush\\\", \\\"project hygiene\\\", \\\"git hygiene\\\", \\\"tidy repo\\\", \\\"clean up this repo\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"brush\"}}},{\"name\":\"capture-experiment\",\"description\":\"Use when writing up a spike or experiment as a zettelkasten note before dead ends and observations are lost. Request-only, needs a title. Triggers on \\\"capture experiment\\\", \\\"log this experiment\\\", \\\"write up this spike\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"capture-experiment\"}}},{\"name\":\"catchup\",\"description\":\"Use when starting work on a project and need local branch/repo context (full diff, GitHub state, capsule refresh). Triggers on \\\"catchup\\\", \\\"catch up\\\", \\\"catch-up\\\", \\\"what changed on this branch\\\", \\\"project overview\\\", \\\"refresh capsule\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"catchup\"}}},{\"name\":\"catchup-ecc\",\"description\":\"Use when scanning new commits in the external affaan-m/everything-claude-code repo for ideas worth adopting. Triggers on \\\"catchup ecc\\\", \\\"check ecc\\\", \\\"what is new in ecc\\\", \\\"check affaan\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"catchup-ecc\"}}},{\"name\":\"catchup-upstream\",\"description\":\"Use when syncing a fork with its upstream remote by reviewing and selectively applying new upstream commits. Triggers on \\\"sync upstream\\\", \\\"catchup upstream\\\", \\\"sync fork\\\", \\\"check upstream\\\".\",\"input\":{\"hint\":\"optional context\"},\"_meta\":{\"kiro\":{\"type\":\"skill\",\"resource\":{\"resourceType\":\"skill\",\"source\":{\"origin\":\"user\"}},\"originalName\":\"catchup-upstream\"}}},{\"name\":\"check-python-compat\",\"description\":\"Use when checking Python code for version-compatibility issues targeting 3.10+. Triggers on \\\"check python compat\