+# PRD 00112 build evidence
+
+Coordinator is Codex; workers are explicitly mapped per host contract. Before implementation, driver.py provider routing was inspected: OpenAI implementation requires Anthropic independent review. That route is supported by this driver; completion review remains a fresh-session obligation.
+
+Plan: five tasks, logical opus. Event/engine/runner/CLI tier_reason contract; documentation tier_reason floor. All estimates below 150K. Backend source route row 2 Claude Opus becomes native gpt-6.1-sol/high under authorized host mapping. CLI visual source Gemini route, if selected, falls back before dispatch to native opus because driver has no independently supported Gemini review route. No unsupported provider contributes. Every implementation/test-writer session will retain observed native metadata.
+
+Design: two reviewed dispatches, no open blockers. Source dispatch identity labels are compatibility labels, actual providers are OpenAI then Anthropic. Full design findings retained. No substantive implementation occurs in coordinator.
+
+Task 1 completed: 18 tests pass, style/split clean, Devon eight exploits strengthened. Pat LOW simplifications rejected with mutant evidence; changelog wording scheduled for task5 consolidation. Task1 red-check could not collect absent ProgressEvent; recorded skip precisely. No full suite run yet.
+Task2 quality retry corrects invented ArchiveMeta/Path and items=None assumptions, and restores omitted PRD compression-fixture success metric before implementation.
+
+Task2:50 tests pass; style clean; split-hygiene failed on a proved pytest-export false positive. One mandated deletion-only correction returned no changes with10-case collection proof. Reflow tripwire24 hunks retained in first attempt. Initial sol opus attempt failed precommit argument-count lint; bounded host-authorized Astra/high repair succeeded, both contributing models retained. Selfdeslop noop; Pat LOW only.
+Task2 Pat review prompt was53563 bytes on the fixed external tool-less use-sonnet lane. Full review ran and its actual LOW verdicts are retained. Budget-scope ambiguity was adjudicated from the Agent-tool-bound wording and external-review transport; do not treat that interpretation as a cap increase or erase the oversized renders from telemetry. Fresh PRD completion review must retain full task coverage. Every native implementation/test/adversary prompt met50000 bytes after at most one trim; no further oversized reviewer prompts are planned.
+
+Task3:21 cases pass, style and split hygiene clean; required __all__ declaration also resolves task2 public-export checker false positive. Initial sol opus attempt failed concrete S110/S112/PLR0917 precommit lint; bounded Astra/high repair passed, both models retained. Full per-task pipeline ran, Devon8 weaknesses strengthened, selfdeslop noop, Pat LOW only. All tasks remain below150K after recalculating mandatory changelog coupling. Planning:5 tasks, phases event -> engines/runner -> CLI -> docs; no derived functional graph; tick seam/final-flush refinement documented in design. Unresolved questions:none.
+
+Task4 pre-dispatch route: CLI live terminal surface selects source UI row1 Gemini. Host contract/driver provides no independent Gemini review route; operator-authorized fallback selects native logical opus gpt-6.1-sol/high even if Gemini CLI is installed. Native test writers use task tier. Actual OpenAI implementation has supported independent Anthropic completion route. ConsoleAdapter.status and result methods share self.console, verified in console.py:71,137-145; status uses stdout by Rich default on this platform.
+
+Task4:46 CLI cases pass, style/split clean; Devon8 gaps strengthened, selfdeslop noop, Pat LOW doc issue fixed with concise return-value docstring; blank-line suggestion rejected with49-line bound. Native UI fallback contributed only OpenAI.
+Task5:docs-only source skips Tess/Devon/Pat; net15 lines triggers selfdeslop trivial skip; no Python style candidates; split skip no-tests. Initial sol doc wording reversed fallback; bounded Astra repair corrected system-tar to Python. RG3 matches per required file. All substantive changes delegated; actual model metadata retained for both doc attempts. No model inherited coordinator effort.
+
+Initial full suite, unisolated process:3failed,6369passed,16skipped,1xfailed,280.00s. Failures are the same inherited Git identity and real portfolio YAML contamination documented by PRD00111; no klyreon/postup/library source changed in this PRD. Existing unchanged00111-verification-runner.py isolates Git author/committer/config environment and empty portfolio roots; it does not omit tests or change HOME. Exact3 failed tests rerun through it:3passed in0.99s. Reusing that runner for the full recorded gate; raw initial failure log retained.
+Additional broad ruff check . found pre-existing E501 at reports/00105-verification-runner.py:22, unchanged at work_start853b765e. Product lint uv run ruff check src/ tests/ tools/ passed. Historical evidence is retained rather than edited to satisfy an extra broad scan. Full mypy557 source files and Sphinx HTML passed.
+
+## Final build verification
+
+All five tasks completed. Hermetic full-suite gate: 6372 passed, 0 failed, 16 skipped, 1 xfailed (169.06s). Canonical last-verification.json was written by run_gate at 1014e6c71744193acc9eebebf7a8f83e6f116b32. Raw logs: 00112-verification-final.log and 00112-verification-unisolated.log. The unchanged PRD00111 wrapper isolates inherited git identity/config and personal portfolio configuration; no tests were omitted or changed.
+
+`uv run ruff check src/ tests/ tools/`, `uv run mypy src/lib/ src/tools/` (557 files), and Sphinx HTML build all passed. Broad repository ruff additionally found the unchanged historical 00105-verification-runner.py E501, retained as a deferred decision. Schema/task counts and all 21 implementation evidence rows validated. Completion review remains for the fresh session; no completion review ran here.
